","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"scene; female","condition":"var 0x4108=3","source":"843 S#3,F#12; 543 m39"}]}],"kind":"scene","gender":"both","legacyNames":["Scene when you come back from the errand"]},{"id":"61-6","name":"The Aide's News About The Thief","events":["NBT-EVT-061-16"],"context":"[NBT-EVT-061-16]\n\n","points":[{"id":"61-6-0","condition":"probably stage H (after Dragon's Den), the first time you walk into the lab after that. The aide walks up to you, then goes back to his place. If this and the eight-badges scene below could both play, this one comes first.","stages":["H"],"ids":["NBT-DLG-061-16a"],"blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","text":"[Player]!\nGuess what!\n\nThe person who took the Professor’s\nPokémon has...come back to return it!\n\nThat’s the last thing I expected!\nGuess what Professor Elm said to him.\n\n...\n\"It seems that your Pokémon already\nlikes you so much.\n\nFor a Pokémon, the best happiness is\nto be with someone it loves.\n\nI think it should stay with you.\"\n\n...\nIsn’t it moving? It made me cry!","id":"61-6-0-block-0","gender":"both"}],"uncertain":true,"evidence":[{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-16a","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"aide","trigger":"scene","condition":"var 0x40FC=2","source":"843 S#16; 543 m56"}]}],"kind":"element","gender":"both","legacyNames":["The aide's news about the thief"]},{"id":"61-7","name":"Scene When You Come Back With Eight Badges","events":["NBT-EVT-061-15"],"context":"[NBT-EVT-061-15]\n\n","points":[{"id":"61-7-0","condition":"probably stage H, the first time you walk into the lab then. Your friend walks up to you.","stages":["H"],"ids":["NBT-DLG-061-15a","NBT-DLG-061-15f","NBT-DLG-061-15b","NBT-DLG-061-15g","NBT-DLG-061-15c","NBT-DLG-061-15h","NBT-DLG-061-15d","NBT-DLG-061-15i","NBT-DLG-061-15e","NBT-DLG-061-15j"],"blocks":[{"type":"note","text":"(boy player, probably)","id":"61-7-0-block-0","gender":"male"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Lyra: [Player]!\nDid you already collect eight Badges?\n\nThat’s so cool!\n\nThe professor is waiting\nfor you.","id":"61-7-0-block-1","gender":"male"},{"type":"note","text":"(girl player, probably)","id":"61-7-0-block-2","gender":"female"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Ethan: [Player]!\nDid you already collect eight Badges?\n\nThat’s so cool!\n\nThe professor is waiting\nfor you.","id":"61-7-0-block-3","gender":"female"},{"type":"note","text":"You both walk up to Elm. Boy and girl players hear the same words from him. You receive a Master Ball; if your Bag is full you do not get it, the same lines still play, and it is not offered again.","id":"61-7-0-block-4","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Professor Elm: Hi, [Player]!\nYou never cease to amaze me!\n\nThanks to you, my research is\ngoing great!\n\nTake this as a token of my\nappreciation.","id":"61-7-0-block-5","gender":"both"},{"type":"note","text":"These two are probably Elm too (no name is shown):","id":"61-7-0-block-6","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"The Master Ball is the best!\n\nIt’s the ultimate Poké Ball! It’ll catch\nany Pokémon without fail.\n\nIt’s given only to noted\nPokémon researchers.\n\nI think you can make much better\nuse of it than I can, [Player]!","id":"61-7-0-block-7","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"By the way...\n\nWe just had a group of beautiful\nKimono Girls looking for you.","id":"61-7-0-block-8","gender":"both"},{"type":"note","text":"Your friend steps up to you, then walks out. Boy and girl players hear the same words except the name (Lyra for a boy player, Ethan for a girl player, probably).","id":"61-7-0-block-9","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Lyra: [Player], people are talking\nabout you!\n\nI heard you helped Kimono Girls?\n\nYou’ve been helping all these people!\nYou make me proud to be your friend.","id":"61-7-0-block-10","gender":"male"},{"type":"note","text":"Elm ends the scene with his Kimono Girls line (\"The Kimono Girls are waiting for you at the Ecruteak Dance Theater.\", under \